   142→    description: |
   143→      REST API contract for HTTP endpoints and WebSocket protocol for real-time communication.
   144→      All REST endpoints return JSON with consistent patterns. WebSocket uses topic-based pub/sub
   145→      with request_id correlation for command acknowledgment.
   146→    depends_on:
   147→      - "@daemon-server"
