   319→        when: page loads
   320→        then: dashboard shows task overview with ready, in_progress, pending_review, blocked, completed
   321→          counts
   322→      - id: ac-2
   323→        given: dashboard is displayed
   324→        when: task counts update on server
   325→        then: counts animate to new values without page refresh (WebSocket-driven)
   326→      - id: ac-3
   327→        given: dashboard is displayed
   328→        when: user clicks a task count badge
   329→        then: navigates to task list filtered by that status
   330→      - id: ac-4
